    "note": "Each cycle: establish pairs and saved state, snapshot, prove cut phase, remove power, confirm discharge, restore power, observe boot, verify automatic restore, measure reconnect, walk all counters. No next cut before verification finishes. Missing journal instrumentation leaves qualification open.",
