      "power.state-restored": "REQUIREMENTS.md REQ-VER-06; issue #396 owner/assignment decisions; Milan v1.2 5.3.5.1, 5.3.7.1, 5.3.8.7, 5.3.11.1, 5.3.13: compare each persisted item against the pre-cut snapshot; commit cuts must restore a complete old or new committed snapshot, never mixed state; missing readback cannot pass",
      "power.adp-valid-time": "REQUIREMENTS.md REQ-VER-06; issue #396 owner/assignment decisions; IEEE 1722.1-2021 6.2.6: after network readiness, the entity advertises within its decoded ADP valid time in seconds",
      "power.rebind-bound": "REQUIREMENTS.md REQ-VER-06; issue #396 owner/assignment decisions; Milan v1.2 5.5.1.4 / 5.5.2.6; issue #75: verify automatic binding restore, then measure CONNECT_RX success to first valid AVTP PDU below 1 second; controller repair of missing saved state cannot satisfy automatic restore",
      "power.counter-walk": "Milan v1.2 Table 5.4 / Table 5.6; REQ-VER-06: snapshot every declared stream index, both directions and CRF, before and after every cycle; validate masks, supported formats, lock/start-stop invariants and flow"
